#ASSERT `Must I tell the agency about my claim` TRUE (`d` 3 11 2026) TRUE (`d` 18 11 2026) (`d` 18 11 2026) EQUALS `I did not tell the agency in time: an offence, up to 10 penalty units (s 53(2))`
