-- s 42.
#ASSERT `Is the agency liable to contribute to my damages` TRUE FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the agency is liable to contribute towards the insurer's liability for treatment, care and support damages (s 42(1))`
#ASSERT `Is the agency liable to contribute to my damages` FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no: no preservation notice has been given (s 42(1))`
-- Contributory negligence: 50% stops it; 49% does not.
#ASSERT `Is the agency liable to contribute to my damages` TRUE TRUE 50 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no longer: contributory negligence reduces my damages by 50% or more (s 42(2)(a))`
#ASSERT `Is the agency liable to contribute to my damages` TRUE TRUE 49 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the agency is liable to contribute towards the insurer's liability for treatment, care and support damages (s 42(1))`
#ASSERT `Is the agency liable to contribute to my damages` TRUE FALSE 0 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no longer: a court refused to sanction my preservation notice (s 42(2)(b))`
#ASSERT `Is the agency liable to contribute to my damages` TRUE FALSE 0 FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no longer: a court made a s 43 order (s 42(2)(c))`
-- Withdrawn: stops it, unless a court sanctioned the notice (s 42(2)(d)).
#ASSERT `Is the agency liable to contribute to my damages` TRUE FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `no longer: I withdrew my preservation notice (s 42(2)(d))`
#ASSERT `Is the agency liable to contribute to my damages` TRUE FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `the agency is liable to contribute towards the insurer's liability for treatment, care and support damages (s 42(1))`

-- s 44(8): a settlement sanctioned on 2 March 2027: by 16 March 2027. An unsanctioned settlement on 20 December 2027:
-- by 3 January 2028 (11 to 31 December, 3 into January). A judgment whose appeal period ended 25 February 2028: by
-- 10 March 2028 (2028 is a leap year: 4 to 29 February, 10 into March).
#ASSERT `By when must I say whether I accept my damages` `under a settlement or judgment that must be sanctioned by a court or the public trustee` (`d` 2 3 2027) EQUALS `d` 16 3 2027
#ASSERT `By when must I say whether I accept my damages` `under a binding settlement that needs no sanction` (`d` 20 12 2027) EQUALS `d` 3 1 2028
#ASSERT `By when must I say whether I accept my damages` `under a final judgment of a court that needs no sanction` (`d` 25 2 2028) EQUALS `d` 10 3 2028
-- s 44(3): $3,000,000 awarded, $400,000 of it for her time in the scheme: the agency pays $2,600,000.
#ASSERT `What happens to my awarded damages` TRUE `I accept the awarded damages` 3000000 400000 `under a settlement or judgment that must be sanctioned by a court or the public trustee` (`d` 2 3 2027) (`d` 10 3 2027) EQUALS `the agency must pay me, in Australian dollars,` 2600000
#ASSERT `What happens to my awarded damages` TRUE `I do not accept the awarded damages` 3000000 400000 `under a settlement or judgment that must be sanctioned by a court or the public trustee` (`d` 2 3 2027) (`d` 10 3 2027) EQUALS `neither the agency nor the insurer must pay the awarded treatment, care and support damages (s 44(5))`
#ASSERT `What happens to my awarded damages` TRUE `I have not yet given notice` 3000000 400000 `under a settlement or judgment that must be sanctioned by a court or the public trustee` (`d` 2 3 2027) (`d` 16 3 2027) EQUALS `I must tell the agency and the insurer whether I accept, by` (`d` 16 3 2027)
-- Finding 6: silence past the acceptance period.
#ASSERT `What happens to my awarded damages` TRUE `I have not yet given notice` 3000000 400000 `under a settlement or judgment that must be sanctioned by a court or the public trustee` (`d` 2 3 2027) (`d` 17 3 2027) EQUALS `the acceptance period has ended without my notice; the Act does not say what follows`
#ASSERT `What happens to my awarded damages` FALSE `I accept the awarded damages` 3000000 400000 `under a binding settlement that needs no sanction` (`d` 2 3 2027) (`d` 10 3 2027) EQUALS `s 44 does not apply: the agency is not liable to contribute, or no treatment, care and support damages were awarded`
#ASSERT EVALTRACE `s 44 -- the participant must say within 14 days whether they accept the awarded damages` 0 (LIST (EVENT `the participant` `give notice accepting or not accepting the awarded damages` 14)) EQUALS FULFILLED
-- expect: BREACH BY the participant, "s 44(2): no notice within the acceptance period; ..." (day 15)
#TRACE `s 44 -- the participant must say within 14 days whether they accept the awarded damages` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the participant` DOES `give notice accepting or not accepting the awarded damages` AT 15

