-- s 52: left 1 March 2027, no claim made. Away to 1 June 2027: exactly 3 months, not more: no power. To 2 June 2027:
-- more than 3 months: the agency may suspend.
#ASSERT `Can the agency suspend my participation` FALSE (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 1 6 2027) `no claim has been made against an insurer for my injury` FALSE EQUALS `s 52 gives the agency no power to suspend me on these facts`
#ASSERT `Can the agency suspend my participation` FALSE (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 2 6 2027) `no claim has been made against an insurer for my injury` FALSE EQUALS `the agency may suspend my participation for all or part of my absence; while suspended I cannot be paid on payment requests (s 52(3), (6))`
#ASSERT `Can the agency suspend my participation` FALSE (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 2 6 2027) `a claim was made, and the insurer denied liability or a court held it not liable` FALSE EQUALS `the agency may suspend my participation for all or part of my absence; while suspended I cannot be paid on payment requests (s 52(3), (6))`
#ASSERT `Can the agency suspend my participation` FALSE (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 2 6 2027) `a claim was made, and liability has not been denied` FALSE EQUALS `s 52 gives the agency no power to suspend me on these facts`
-- s 52(2): harm to her condition, after 10 days away.
#ASSERT `Can the agency suspend my participation` FALSE (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 11 3 2027) `a claim was made, and liability has not been denied` TRUE EQUALS `the agency may suspend my participation for all or part of my absence; while suspended I cannot be paid on payment requests (s 52(3), (6))`
#ASSERT `Can the agency suspend my participation` TRUE (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 2 9 2027) `no claim has been made against an insurer for my injury` TRUE EQUALS `s 52 does not apply to a buy-in participant (s 13(5))`

